<title>USA: LCI says 1.45 mln share offering withdrawn.</title>
<headline>LCI says 1.45 mln share offering withdrawn.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, VA. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>LCI International on Wednesday said some of its stockholders withdrew their request for a secondary offering of 1.45 million shares because of the poor performance of long-distance company stocks recently.</p>
<p>The shares to be sold were part of the 4.6 million shares LCI distributed to former shareholders of the Corporate Telemanagement Group, the company said.</p>
<p>LCI bought the company in September 1995, it added.</p>
